# Curated fonts for `plaque-forge list fonts` and for the `bundle-media` build.
#
# One entry per line; blank lines and `#` comments are ignored. Entries resolve
# in this order in every font listing, each printed with a `*` prefix:
#   - `fonts/<file>`  repository-pinned font file (embedded verbatim by bundle-media)
#   - anything else   system fontconfig family name; `bundle-media` embeds the
#                     file that the building machine's `fc-match` resolves for it,
#                     recording its SHA-256 as provenance
#
# Keep this list small: each entry becomes an embedded file in bundled builds.
# Script-specific Noto families (Noto Sans Devanagari, Noto Serif Tamil, ...)
# are intentionally omitted; add one only when a title actually needs it.

fonts/NotoSerif-Regular.ttf
Noto Serif
Noto Serif Display
Noto Sans
Noto Sans Mono
